m of internal conflict today?Organize", "conf": 0.911, "box": [[162, 1125], [819, 1120], [819, 1145], [163, 1149]]}, {"text": "a debate among students. Encourage the students to learn about Saladin Day", "conf": 0.923, "box": [[160, 1143], [819, 1142], [819, 1169], [160, 1170]]}, {"text": "which is celebrated in different parts of Europe in the context of tolerance.", "conf": 0.91, "box": [[162, 1167], [752, 1164], [753, 1187], [163, 1190]]}, {"text": "（45）", "conf": 0.565, "box": [[424, 1197], [458, 1197], [458, 1227], [424, 1227]]}]}